        <p>Is IN A. a , ) _</p>
        <p>iNEW SIZE Trial,</p>
        <p>_ WOOD'S TUTORIAL COLLEGE. Residents in Warrington and District will learn with interest that it has not taken very long for the new local branch of Wood's Tutorial College—the premier commercial and Civil Service Institution—to prove itself a distinct success. It is pleasing to record that. the successes of this college have now reached the grand total of six thousand. It is most effectively solving the difficult problem of congenial and remunera- tive employment for girls and boys, many local pupils having already been placed in business houses in the district as clerks, shorthand-typists, cashiers and book- keepers, while others have been equally successful in securing much-coveted Civil Service appointments.</p>
