      </div>
      <div type="article" xml:id="PressMint-GB_1913-03-15_WidnesExaminer_art0066" n="art0066">
        <head>WESLEYAN CHURCH.</head>
        <p>WESLEYAN CHURCH.</p>
        <p>A tea and Japanese entertainment were given in the Lecture Hall on Saturday by the young ladies of the congregation. Miss Holman occupied the chair at the ensuing proceedings, with Miss E Teece as secretary, and Miss Watkins as conductor. The programme con- tained many topical sketches.</p>
        <p>INSTANT RELIEF RAPID CURE of GOUT AND RHEUMATISM by MAIM'S PILLS. COULD NOT SLEEP WITH PAIN!</p>
